  "check_3_payout_recompute": "PASS EXACTLY - all 56 rows recomputed from events + rules match the payout tab's Realized Return to better than 1e-6. expected.realized_return carries the EXACT cell values read from the workbook (e.g. Iowa $9,848.177778, Texas $7,078.377778, Michigan $35,314.95), not the whole-dollar display. All 9 owner-level Entry and Realized Return figures also reproduce exactly; the only deviation anywhere is $0.0054 on Zach's cost, from the contract-mandated 0.333334 third on Florida. Independent confirmation: the 56 Realized Return values sum to exactly $138,490.00 = the pot.",
